  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: merge PDFs, split PDFs, and HTML to PDF with a built-in renderer; tables that continue across pages with repeated header rows; headers, footers, page numbers, and a body flow that adds pages as needed; JPEG and PNG images, also in table cells; colors from RGB or hex; .NET 11 support. Part of the API is renamed, so code written for 0.0.x needs the new names. The full change list and the upgrade table: https://github.com/unlimited-docs/UnlimitedPDF#changes-in-100",
